    metaTitle: "Digital Marketing for Plumbers Guide",
    excerpt: "A comprehensive, channel-by-channel guide to digital marketing specifically for plumbing businesses.",
    metaDescription: "A channel-by-channel guide to digital marketing for plumbing businesses, covering local SEO, paid search, and converting emergency calls into booked jobs.",
